  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 The focus of the work of GWP(O) is to promote and support the implementation of integrated water resources management (IWRM) through a network of regional and country member organisations. GWP is a facilitating network/organisation and not an implementing body. Its role is to facilitate processes and implementation, stimulate debate, and be a broker of knowledge and experiences.</narrative>
